// After School: everyone in town, and the way home. Each person's node is
// named in world.ldtk (their entity's `node`); the variables are the game's
// own (bound in src/scenes/town.cpp), so every conversation sees what the
// others decided.
//
//   $hour          the town's clock, an hour of the afternoon (15 to 19)
//   $with          who you go to the festival with: "", "mika" or "sora"
//   $met_*         whom you have talked to
//   $raced         Kai's race, run
//
// has_item("flyer") and <<walk who place>> and <<ending kind>> are the game's
// (on_function and on_command in src/scenes/town.cpp).

title: Mika
---
<<declare $hour = 15>>
<<declare $with = "">>
<<declare $met_mika = false>>
<<declare $met_sora = false>>
<<declare $met_aki = false>>
<<declare $met_kai = false>>
<<declare $raced = false>>
<<if $met_mika == false>>
    Mika: You survived the last class of the week! #line:mika_hi #mood:happy
    Mika: The lantern festival starts at seven. Everyone's going. #line:mika_festival
    <<set $met_mika = true>>
<<else>>
    Mika: Still here? It's already {$hour - 12} o'clock. #line:mika_again #mood:think
<<endif>>
-> Want to go to the festival together? <<if has_item("flyer") and $with == "">> #line:mika_ask
    Mika: With you? [wave]Yes![/wave] Meet me at the gate at seven. #line:mika_yes #mood:happy
    <<set $with = "mika">>
-> Have you seen Sora? #line:mika_sora
    Mika: He was moping by the pond. Come on, I'll show you. #line:mika_show #mood:think
    <<walk Mika pond>>
    Mika: There. Go cheer him up. #line:mika_there
-> I should get going. #line:mika_bye
    Mika: See you around! #line:mika_later
===

title: Sora
---
<<if $met_sora == false>>
    Sora: Oh. Hi. #line:sora_hi #mood:sad
    Sora: The band plays at the festival tonight, and I lost my nerve. And my pick. #line:sora_nerve #mood:sad
    <<set $met_sora = true>>
<<else>>
    Sora: [shake]I can't do this.[/shake] #line:sora_again #mood:sad
<<endif>>
-> You'll be great. I'll be in the front row. <<if $with == "">> #line:sora_promise
    Sora: ...You'd do that? [pause=0.4/]Then I'll play. For real. #line:sora_yes #mood:happy
    <<set $with = "sora">>
-> Try the café. Aki knows everybody. #line:sora_cafe
    Sora: Aki? She scares me a little. #line:sora_aki #mood:think
-> Good luck. #line:sora_bye
===

title: Aki
---
<<if $met_aki == false>>
    Aki: Club captain, at your service. Have you seen the flyers for tonight? #line:aki_hi #mood:happy
    Aki: Someone dropped one over by the east trees. #line:aki_flyer #mood:think
    <<set $met_aki = true>>
<<elseif has_item("flyer")>>
    Aki: You found it! Now you have an excuse to ask someone. #line:aki_found #mood:happy
<<else>>
    Aki: The flyer, east of the pond. Go! #line:aki_again
<<endif>>
===

title: Kai
---
<<if $raced>>
    Kai: Next time I'm winning. #line:kai_again #mood:think
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Kai: Race you to the station! Now or never! #line:kai_hi #mood:happy
<<set $met_kai = true>>
-> You're on! #line:kai_race
    Kai: [speed=2]Three, two, one... GO![/speed] #line:kai_go #mood:happy
    <<set $raced = true>>
    <<set $hour = $hour + 1>>
    Kai: An hour of running and we're right back here. It's {$hour - 12} now. #line:kai_back #mood:sad
-> Not today. #line:kai_no
    Kai: Your loss! #line:kai_loss #mood:think
===

title: Home
---
<<if $with == "mika">>
    Mika: There you are! Look, the lanterns! #line:end_mika #mood:happy
    <<ending festival>>
<<elseif $with == "sora">>
    Sora: You came. Front row, like you said. #line:end_sora #mood:happy
    <<ending concert>>
<<elseif $hour < 17>>
    You think about going home, but the afternoon isn't over yet. #line:home_early
<<else>>
    The lanterns rise over town. You watch them from your window. #line:end_home
    <<ending home>>
<<endif>>
===

// Seven o'clock, wherever you are: the scene starts this one itself.
title: Seven
---
The bell of the school strikes seven. #line:seven_bell
<<if $with == "mika">>
    Mika: There you are! Come on, they're lighting the lanterns! #line:seven_mika #mood:happy
    <<ending festival>>
<<elseif $with == "sora">>
    Sora: You made it. Front row, like you said. #line:seven_sora #mood:happy
    <<ending concert>>
<<else>>
    The first lanterns rise over the roofs. You watch them from the street. #line:seven_alone
    <<ending home>>
<<endif>>
===
